---
name: Fetch HarfangLab events as OCSF
description: |
  Drains the Splunk pull export of a HarfangLab Manager every minute and
  publishes the OCSF events as the Manager exports them.
---

// Store the API token of a dedicated HarfangLab user in the secret
// `harfanglab-api-token`, without the `Token` prefix.
harfanglab::fetch "https://example.hurukai.io:8443",
  token=secret("harfanglab-api-token")
publish "harfanglab"
